+  // THE UN-WIDENED CONTROL IS A PATH, not a swatch (pass-3 critique §2.4: `.player-swatch`
+  // reads a `background-color` and was never in the widened selector — a colour reading, not a
+  // control for this rule). The control here is every OTHER `path` the estate ships on this
+  // page: same property, same element kind, outside `index.css:989 / :1012`'s pair. If one of
+  // them moves with the tick, the rule is not scoped and the row reds.
